# =====================================================================
# Operator allowlist — per-environment tuning (no code change / rebuild)
#
# Copy this file to  config/allowlist.local.conf  and add one trusted
# substring pattern per line. A process whose image path OR command line
# contains any pattern (case-insensitive) is suppressed BEFORE threat
# classification, exactly like specs/exclusions.py OPERATOR_ALLOWLIST.
#
# Rules:
#   * one pattern per line; blank lines and lines starting with '#' ignored
#   * keep patterns SPECIFIC so an attacker cannot ride on them
#     (prefer a full path or a distinctive flag, not a bare exe name)
#
# Everything NOT matched here is still fully analysed.
# =====================================================================

# ---- Examples (uncomment / edit for your site) ----------------------
# \jenkins\
# \gitlab-runner\
# deploy.ps1
# c:\program files\trusted-agent\
# /opt/company/backup-agent
# ansible-playbook
